{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-085", "score": 0.154, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-085 | Study family SF-APPS-085: Connector teammate-path quality Q_p split-half reliability\n- observed_research_question: Connector teammate-path quality Q_p split-half reliability\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector quality Q_p (teammate-initiated on-off PPP gap) is a stable player-season attribute.\n- observed_result: Pearson r(Q_a,Q_b)=+0.215 p=0.0297; Spearman rho=+0.242. Spearman-Brown Q~0.355, S~0.278. Sign agreement 65.7% (67/102) binomial p=0.000996. ICC(player-season)=0.216 (78.4% within). Attenuation: even a perfect predictor  [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: Split-half r=0.215 / SB 0.355 is too low to treat Q_p as a stable scoutable trait; most variance is within-player half-to-half.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=102 connectors\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-086"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-005", "score": 0.142, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-005 | Study family SF-APPA-005: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- observed_research_question: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Playoff defenses change scheme within games and between games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.\n- observed_result: Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 523 cells; 440 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-021", "score": 0.098, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-021 | Study family SF-APPM-021: Within-game tactical adaptation (halftime, crunch, post-run)\n- observed_research_question: Within-game tactical adaptation (halftime, crunch, post-run)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Describe how play-type mix shifts by halftime margin, crunch time and after runs.\n- observed_result: OTHER +2.26 to +2.48pp in H2 in every bucket; crunch OTHER +6.08pp, PULL_UP +1.20pp at -0.045 PPP; post-run DRIVE +3.75pp, OTHER -6.72pp.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: No inferential tests; OTHER label known to be noisy (PT audit).\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF17", "score": 0.098, "document": "# FAM:SF17 | Study family SF17: Wiring confirmatory: persistence (P1a) and irreducibility to play-type rates (P1b)\n- observed_research_question: Wiring confirmatory: persistence (P1a) and irreducibility to play-type rates (P1b)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Team offensive association structure is more similar to itself across split halves than to other teams, even after residualizing play-type rates.\n- observed_result: [APPS-080] Gate: C1 8/8 p<0.05; C2 S=0.319 perm_p=0.0002; C3 R2=0.080 PASS. Full: frobenius P1a S=0.352 p=0.0000 CI[0.327,0.378]; P1b S=0.353 CI[0.329,0.379]; cosine P1a 0.155 / P1b 0.144. residual_R2=0.043. D_obs mean=3 [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [CHT-049] Residual R^2=0.043. Frobenius P1a S=0.352 p=0.0000 CI [0.327, 0.378]; P1b S=0.353 [0.329, 0.379]. Cosine P1a S=0.155 [0.132, 0.179]; P1b S=0.144 [0.123, 0.170]. All p<0.01.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: [CHT-049] NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-001"}], "n_results": 4}

Stage 2. Using the retrieval result above (follow-up tools are allowed within the tool budget), complete steps 4 to 9
and reply with the final action. Output schema (all fields required):
{
